check_fmriprep_logs
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Read fMRIPrep stdout/stderr logs, classify each run as Successful / Failed /
In Progress / Unfinished, optionally cross-check against derivatives on disk,
and write a CSV + HTML summary.
"""

